servatory Deck, Acupressure pathway, Jacuzzi, Kids Play Area and many more. RERA approved project.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹40,000\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹35,000**\n\n14% above avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹40,000/sqft** — **58% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2023\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n2 BHK632–711 ft²₹2.53 Cr–₹2.84 Cr\n\n3 BHK856–956 ft²₹3.42 Cr–₹3.82 Cr\n\nShop472–1,495 ft²₹1.89 Cr–₹5.98 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Ruparel%20Palacio%20Ph%20I%20(RERA%20P51800013681))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800013681\n\nRegistered\n\n2021-09-09\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nKOTAK MAHINDRA BANK LIMITED\n\nArchitect\n\nRahul Kamathi\n\nTotal FSI\n\n4177\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nRuparel Palacio— floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Kandivali  \n19.2061076,72.8350123\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nShree Siddhivinayak Infrastructure & RealtyNA\n\nRahul KamathiArchitect\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n2½ BHK855 ft²₹3.42 Cr—\n\n3 BHK935 ft²₹3.74 Cr—\n\n3 BHK955 ft²₹3.82 Cr—\n\n09\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n27% a