l below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\nSOURCE · MAHARERA + MUMBAI PROPERTY EXCHANGE  \nINDEPENDENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Ruparel%20Palacio%20Ph%20I%20(RERA%20P51800013681))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Ruparel%20Palacio%20Ph%20I%20(RERA%20P51800013681))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Kandivali — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nCodename Capital World, Thane West\n\nNew launch in Thane West — ₹14,382/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from